# Only the two Rust crates' sources go into the image build (the engine's
# assets are fetched from GitHub at the pinned commit).
*
!engine-rs/Cargo.toml
!engine-rs/Cargo.lock
!engine-rs/build.rs
!engine-rs/src
!web/Cargo.toml
!web/Cargo.lock
!web/src
# render.ts, the TypeScript fallback, and its one package
!render.ts
!package.json
!package-lock.json
